{"unit_id":"bitsmug__dsh-bgjobs#card-zh","repo":"bitsmug/dsh-bgjobs","commit":"cd34e6c017ef51e76ee57002c74fdba2b79fcc8d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"bgjobs（DSH 插件，网页客户端）：把较长命令交给 Windows 任务计划程序托管，使任务在 DSH 关闭后仍可运行。它向 agent 提供后台任务提交、状态查询与等待工具，并在网页提供任务监控面板，可查看输出、管理完成任务，也可管理 MCP 工具调用和离线 CLI/GUI。适合希望把编译、下载或批处理放到后台执行的 DSH 用户。运行依赖 Windows 任务计划程序及 PowerShell/Node.js 环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:41","lib/core/apply.js:19","lib/core/tools.js:160","lib/core/web.js:1"]}
{"unit_id":"bitsmug__dsh-bgjobs#card-en","repo":"bitsmug/dsh-bgjobs","commit":"cd34e6c017ef51e76ee57002c74fdba2b79fcc8d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"bgjobs is a DSH web plugin that runs long commands as Windows Task Scheduler jobs, so they continue after DSH closes. Agents can submit jobs, check status, wait, and inspect output in a web monitor. It supports MCP jobs and offline CLI/GUI management. Requires Windows, PowerShell, and Node.js.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:41","lib/core/apply.js:19","lib/core/tools.js:160","lib/core/web.js:1"]}
